  (text "Battery optional: one bare 1S Li-ion/LiPo cell, at least 2000 mAh, with a 10k B3380 NTC on the cell (3-wire JST PH: 1 -, 2 NTC, 3 +)."
    (at 20 380 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "db9c5f0d-b60b-618d-232c-97ea53d3feea"))
  (text "Three independent layers: charger (VREG, ICHG, JEITA from the pack NTC, safety timer), BQ29700 + 2 FETs (OV 4.275 V, UV 2.8 V, OC about 2 A, short), 3 A fuse."
    (at 20 385 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "f9da030b-6ef0-91f0-caf2-f17a423944c5"))
  (text "Charger I2C address 0x6B on I2C1 (shared with the BMM350 at 0x14). Firmware: SYS_MIN 3.7 V, ICHG at most 1 A (0.5C), IINDPM from the CC level, watchdog on."
    (at 20 390 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "08a016d7-5e70-8db4-3e94-c217cfbffe6a"))
  (text "Hold-up with no cell: VSYS of 3.9 to 4.2 V down to 3.0 V gives the 0.5 F about 1.5 to 2 J, about 1.5 s at 1.2 W with the radio off."
    (at 20 395 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "5cbc8d78-56be-0879-e07a-02c3c2b431e5"))
  (text "PWR_FAIL_N goes low when VBUS falls below about 4.3 V. With a cell fitted the firmware keeps logging and watches VBAT_SENSE instead."
    (at 20 400 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "aaea41f2-377f-85c6-089e-5b0ddc9254e7"))
  (text "Off: firmware sets BATFET_DIS (ship mode). On: PWR held 1 s, or USB plugged in."
    (at 20 405 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "8474d91e-8733-1c53-27ef-368b21fd6cb3")))
